ections </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How do I get to \u2026 ?<br />  Where is ... ?  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Make a right/left.<br />Head north/south/east/ west on \u2026<br />behind<br />toward<br />past<br />across<br />    in front of</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "banner "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a long piece of cloth with writing on it, hangs between two poles "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That banner up there is for the San Francisco Festival of India."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about places in a town."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "heritage "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the traditional customs of a country "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That's the celebration of Indian heritage and culture. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "attendee "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who is at an event  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: All attendees at the festival can enjoy a parade."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "arts and crafts "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "objects that are both useful and beautiful "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can buy many arts and crafts at the festival."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bazaar "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area where there are a lot of small shops "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a bazaar where you can buy many things."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bevy "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large group of things "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a bevy of yummy food options."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le07ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Prepositions of Place"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the preposition <span class=\"strong\">in</span> to show that something is enclosed.<br/><br/>You use the preposition <span class = \"strong\">at</span>  to show position within land-areas.<br/><br/>You use the preposition  <span class = \"strong\">on</span> to show a position on a horizontal or vertical surface.<br/><br/>You use the preposition <span class = \"strong\">across</span> to show movement along or through something.<br/><br/>You use the preposition <span class = \"strong\">between</span> to describe something in the middle of two things."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Preposition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in Wiltshire\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at the special stone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the same spot\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"across\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"across the top\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"between\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"between the stones\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose an English-speaking city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. Find a festival that is going to happen in that city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out what you can do and where is it happening in the city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write directions about how to get there."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss the festival and read the directions aloud to your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about an event and places in a town or city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write directions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I communicate the directions to my partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}